<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="39d01945">Have a subject matter resource with in-depth experience on the package components perform the analysis.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="7a10120"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="5ef7bcca"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="27b1fd4c">&lt;p&gt;
    A list of gaps that help communicate key high-level improvements or enhancements and presents a detailed analysis of
    “out of the box” functionality versus requirements and business processes to the client. The analysis compares both
    business and system requirements against standard package functionality.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Gap analysis for the package should indicate the degree of fit and:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Whether the gap can be supported out of the box
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        The configuration required using administration utilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        The configuration required by the vendor
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Extensions required
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Core enhancements required
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Items that cannot be supported
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
</Element>
